Look for "AppData/Local/Frickbears3". Go inside, and look for a folder titled "addons". If there's not already a folder titled "addons" in the Frickbears3 folder, create one and put this character's folder inside it.Incase you don't know how to add the mod properly, drag the file into the addons folder (Not the extracted zip file or the one with numbers, from inside the extracted folder) and it should work properly.{"FULL_NAME":"X","DEV_NOTES":"Character created by JoeDoughBoi.\nMod made by Marco Antonio.\n\ni must say i have a fucked up obsession with this guy\nit is a surprise to do mods for this game when i worked on the actual thing, but its funny as hell seeing this guy show up in all sorts of games lol","DESCRIPTION":"DEBUT: SONIC.EXE. (2011)\n\nComing from within the void of space itself, X is a really messed up guy that finds entertainment out of torturing people inside his pocket dimension via a haunted CD, dragging them inside the game once they boot it up... \nX has a weird fascination with Sonic the Hedgehog and has warped his world and appearance around him. no one knows his actual motives but, one things for sure: he is quite the playmate!"} ‰PNG
