	"FULL_NAME": "Fleetway Super Sonic",
	"DEV_NOTES": "Created by NotUrAveragePerson.\n\ni made this mod purely out of boredom lowkey. fleetway is one of my favorite sonic characters or villians you could say and with frickbears trending, i thought it be fun to try something new. This is my first mod i've ever worked on so im kinda new to this. Anyways enjoy the mod.",
	"DESCRIPTION": "DEBUT: Sonic The Comic (1993)\n\nUnlike his original heroic counterpart, Sonic The Hedgehog, Super Sonic (Or Fleetway if you want to differentiate from the canon Super Sonic) is a destructive, psychotic and violent entity and transformation of Sonic who takes over his body whenever he is in trouble or is under too much stress. He was created during the radiation exposure of the chaos emeralds, taking over his possession to destroy everyone as he wishes and pleases. However, several issues later, he now existed as a separate entity from Sonic after being sent to the special zone by Amy and Tails, now destroying everyone or thing as he wish. In Sonic the Comic, a lot of things work very differently compared to traditional Sonic settings and when Sonic becomes his famous alter-ego, his inner darkness is unleashed in a spectacular, world-shattering flurry of unbridled violence. As a Nightguard at Frickbears, normally he would just turn the animatronics into scrap heap, but where's the fun in that, huh?"
