VA Bit by Expressly
Character owned by JoeDoughBoi!\n\nWell, here it is, the big ol revamp update that finally wraps up everything! I enjoyed working on this mod a lot and I'm happy with where it is now to fully say I probably won't come back to it unless another big frickbears update happens that makes me WANT to come back to it So, with that being said, Enjoy it! I know I did.",
