)İÑ»åÿ}Vøæl×´õ?X”İäüÊàa␀␀␀␀IEND®B`‚{"DIALOGUE":
	[
		["...Ugh, Alright, listen up kid.", "Super Sonic"],
		["Don't expect me to be good at this stuff, I've never done this before.", "Super Sonic"],
		["But, I wouldn't call you selfish at all, honestly.", "Super Sonic"],
		["I don't know what being stuck here for eternity would feel like, but I can tell it's more painful than death.", "Super Sonic"],
		["Hell, I've had to share a body with this fool named, Sonic. It was similar yet unpleasant experience.", "Super Sonic"],
		["But this? Jeez, can't imagine how you've felt being trapped here.", "Super Sonic"],
		["...And, well, you don't have to go alone. Your friends can come along too.", "Super Sonic"],
		["Even though I don't really care about having any.", "Super Sonic"],
		["...But, after all that I did...", "Cassidy"],
		["...Would they even st-still want to be my friends anymore?", "Cassidy"],
		["...", "Super Sonic"],
		["...Look. I can't say for sure. I don't know what this 'friendship' feels like.", "Super Sonic"],
		["I understand that your friends abandoning you feels like the world around you is crumbling to ashes.", "Super Sonic"],
		["Yeah, they'll be mad. But that's fine. Everyone get mad sometimes.", "Super Sonic"],
		["The best you could do is give your friends some time away to clear their thoughts or somethin.'", "Super Sonic"],
		["Trust me, kid. No matter how far away from you they are, as long you keep persisting and fighting for them, that's what matters, I guess.", "Super Sonic"],
		["I mean like, keeping them trapped here forever wouldn't end up pretty in the long run.", "Super Sonic"],
		["Again, you just gotta let them take some time off.", "Super Sonic"],
		["My point is, don't just assume this is the end.", "Super Sonic"],
		["You still have a chance to reconnect together if you keep trying. Well, not too hard.", "Super Sonic"],
		["Stay strong, because it's gonna take more than this to take you down.", "Super Sonic"],
		["I...", "Cassidy"],
		["...", "Cassidy"],
		["...You're right.", "Cassidy"],
		["It...it isn't right to keep them all down here.", "Cassidy"],
		["...It isn't right to keep myself down here.", "Cassidy"],
		["It isn't right to let myself down, even if they're gone.", "Cassidy"],
		["Whatever's there for us after everything's over...they're still my friends. At least, I still believe that...", "Cassidy"],
		["...Still, I...I don't like saying goodbye.", "Cassidy"],
		["I'll...I'll see you again someday, won't I?", "Cassidy"],
		["Eh... Don't count on it.", "Super Sonic"],
		["I'll probably be out there causing terror and destruction around the world...", "Super Sonic"],
		["And getting revenge on Sonic and the freedom fighters after I've recovered all my Chaos Energy.", "Super Sonic"],
		["But that'll have to wait for now.", "Super Sonic"],
		["...But right now, don't give up that easily.", "Super Sonic"],
		["...Haha, yeah...", "Cassidy"],
		["...Thank you...", "Cassidy"],
		["Don't mention it.", "Super Sonic"],
		["Aswell, I should definitely get a cooler name while I'm at it.", "Super Sonic"],
