}{"DIALOGUE":
	[
		["...Ah, who do we have here?", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func",
			[
				["addActor", 1, "sTalksprites_Michael"], 
				["playMusic", "musMidnight_Michael", 1], 
				["fadeMusic", "musMidnight_Michael", 1, 0]
			]
		],
		
		["Pardon me, but...you ARE the night watchman at this location, yes?", "Hooded Man"],
		["(Jeez, who is this guy? Why does he look dead under that hood? He smells like dead skunk, eugh.)", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 2]]],
		["You look slightly small for a job like this, and I've never thought they'd let a Hedgehog be the night watchman.", "Hooded Man"],
		["Hey, I'm more than just a Hedgehog! I'm SUPER SONIC!", "Super Sonic"],
		["So I wouldn't recommend doubting my capablities, fool.", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 4]]],
		["Ah, sorry. Didn't mean to... well, doubt you.", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 1]]],
		["My name is Michael. Nice to meet you.", "Michael"],
		["Cool, Micheal, got it.", "Super Sonic"],
		["...So ya want something from me or ya wanna just bug off, huh?", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 0]]],
		["Sorry, pardon my sudden appearance, it's just that...there was something I wished to ask of you.", "Michael"],
		["Listen pal, ya want somethin?' Well ya made a mistake picking me. I can just burn you to a crisp if you even try to get close.", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 1]]],
		["Oh no, no no, I want nothing like that! It's, well...", "Michael"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 1]]],
		["Do you recognize this?", "Michael"],
		["Out from his dingy sweater, Michael presents something familiar...", ""],
		["...It's that Freddy mask you pried from the puppet's hands last night!", ""],
		["Oh that, well...", "Super Sonic"],
		["...Wait a minute, how the hell did you get that? I swear I just had...", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 2]]],
		["I would've thought even you newer hires would at least remember to keep the entrances locked...", "Michael"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
		["Or did your training go with the rest of the budget cuts?", "Michael"],
		["Oh, so you're still doubting what I can do, huh? You sure ya wanna go out on me? Because things would get pretty ugly!", "Super Sonic"],
		
		["_func", [["setActor", 4]]],
		["...Just a light joke. Settle down there.", "Michael"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 5]]],
		["Anyway, I just couldn't help but wonder what use you would have for something like this, knowing the hoops you must've jumped through to get it.", "Michael"],
		["It's just some stupid mask toy, ya really think I need this?", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 0]]],
		["...Ah, right then, I suppose I never did explain myself, did I?", "Michael"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 4]]],
		["You see, as for myself...I suppose you could say I have a...loose end or two to tie up. A bit of a personal score to settle.", "Michael"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
		["And in order to do so...I need these masks. All four of them.", "Michael"],
		["Wait, you really want me to...", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 0]]],
		["...Bring the rest to me, correct.", "Michael"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 2]]],
		["If you intend to continue visiting the other abandoned Freddy's locations as you have been already, you should quickly find the rest.", "Michael"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 5]]],
		["I simply ask that you continue to collect them all and bring them to me.", "Michael"],
		["...Ok, just wait a minute, you expect me to run your stupid errands? Alongside, I have no idea who you are.", "Super Sonic"],
		["Nope. Can't believe you'd think I'd be responsible for getting you toys that kids would probably play with.", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 2]]],
		["I suppose nothing about this really does benefit you, does it?", "Michael"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 0]]],
		["Though, if you do choose to do so regardless...", "Michael"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 1]]],
		["...Know that you'd be making an old friend of mine very, very happy.", "Michael"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
		["I trust you to make the right decision.", "Michael"],
		["_func",
			[
				["removeActor"], 
				["fadeMusic", "musMidnight_Michael", 0, 1000]
			]
		],
		
		["...And, just as suddenly as he appeared, the mysterious hooded man disappeared into the darkness.", ""],
		["...Pft, please, that guy expects me to bring that junk to him like I'm his errand boy.", "Super Sonic"],
		["Whatever the hell he was talking about, he's talking to someone who caused absolute destruction and torture in the past.", "Super Sonic"],
		["HAHA! THE SCREAMS OF TERROR AND PAIN! GREAT MEMORIES!", "Super Sonic"],
		["_effect", 0, 100, "Shake"],
		["...Ugh, whatever. I've got a job to do, might as well get it over with.", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["salvage"]]]
	]
} {"DIALOGUE":
	[
		["There's...two people outside?", ""],
		["...It seems that they're arguing.", ""],
		["_func",
			[
				["addActor", 5, "sTalksprites_Michael"], 
				["playMusic", "musMidnight_MissingChild", 1], 
				["fadeMusic", "musMidnight_MissingChild", 1, 0]
			]
		],
		
		["If you knew what was good for you, you'd leave him to me. Neither of you have any idea what you're getting yourselves into here.", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["switchActor", [6, 1], "sTalksprites_Vanny"]]],
		["What, so YOU can boss him around? Fat chance! You REEK of ulterior motives!", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 7]]],
		["...In fact, you reek in general. Jeez, why do you smell like that?", "White Rabbit"],

		["_func",
						[
						["switchActor", [0, 0]],
						["playSound", "sfxMetalImpact", 10, false, 0.5]
					]
				],
		["HEY!", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["switchActor", [2, 1]]]],
		["Quit talkin before I rip off those annoying mouths off!", "Super Sonic"],
		["_skip"],
		["_func", [["switchActor", [1, 0]]]],
		["...Ah, there you are! Sorry about that, I was hoping to-", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["switchActor", [1, 1]]]],
		["Well hel-LO there, gorgeous! Yes, you're just who I wanted to see!", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
		["_skip"],
		["Wow! You look so cute, so fluffy, and-", "White Rabbit"],
		["_skip"],
		["WHAT DID YOU JUST CALL ME-", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["switchActor", [5, 0]]]],
		["Hey, I was talking!", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["switchActor", [3, 1]]]],
		["Ladies first, stinky! It's not like you had anything worthwhile to say, anyhow...", "White Rabbit"],
		["...Would love some context right now.", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 0]]],
		["Well boy, have no worries! See, you've got a little something I want.", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 2]]],
		["...Well, you got a LOT, actually, but whatever that other stuff you brought home with you was doesn't matter to me right now.", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 5]]],
		["You know that green, moldy bunny guy you salvaged? See, funny thing...he actually belongs to ME.", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["switchActor", [2, 0]]]],
		["Under what circumstances!? You know neither of you should be handling that...that thing!", "Hooded Man"],
		
		["_func", [["setActor", 1]]],
		["Listen, er...what was your name?", "Hooded Man"],
		["It's Super Sonic.", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 0]]],
		["Super Sonic... Never heard of that name...", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 1]]],
		["I apologize if we got off on the wrong foot, but I only want to make one thing clear.", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
		["Certain things at this company are not to be trifled with. That rabbit is very much one of them.", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["switchActor", [2, 1]]]],
		["...Do you mean Springtrap, or do you mean me?", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["switchActor", [0, 0]]]],
		["I understand that you're new around here. Consider yourself lucky that you still have time to change course.", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 4]]],
		["Being around as long as I have, I know I have my share fair of regrets. If I were in your shoes, well...", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 0]]],
		["...I would've loved to get out while I still had the chance.", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["switchActor", [4, 1]]]],
		["Are you...threatening him?", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["switchActor", [1, 0]]]],
		["I am only warning you. Both of you.", "Hooded Man"],
		
		["_func", [["setActor", 5]]],
		["If you continue down this path, touching things that should not be touched...", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
		["...I feel you won't be happy when they come back to bite you.", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["switchActor", [5, 1]]]],
		["Tch...you would know a thing about bites, wouldn't you?", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["switchActor", [0, 0]]]],
		["...Excuse me?", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["switchActor", [2, 1]]]],
		["Oh, c'mon, what's with that look? It was just a joke...", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
		["Oh well...you get the picture, don't you, Super?", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 0]]],
		["You've got two choices here! You can go along with me...or you can bore yourself to death with whatever THAT guy's got planned.", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 1]]],
		["I have a feeling you'll make the right choice in the end.", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func",
			[
				["setObject", "oTalksprite", "sprite_index", [true, "sNOTHING"]],
				["removeActor"],
				["fadeMusic", "musMidnight_MissingChild", 0, 1000]
			]
		],
		
		["...And, just like that, the mysterious white rabbit hopped, skipped and jumped back into the darkness.", ""],
		["_func",[["addActor", 4, "sTalksprites_Michael"]]],
		["...Phew. Good riddance.", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 1]]],
		["Listen, er...Super Sonic, was it?", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 2]]],
		["I like to believe you have good intentions with...whatever it is you're doing here, even if I do not fully understand them.", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
		["In fact, I appreciate that you brought that mask back with you. If you happen to find any more, I would love to take them off your hands.", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 1]]],
		["Just...steer clear of that rabbit, will you?", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 4]]],
		["You'll be better off if you don't get your hands dirty.", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func",[["removeActor"]]],
		
		["...And the hooded man takes his leave as well.", ""],
		["...They really expected me to process any of that that fast?", "Super Sonic"],
		["Freaks.", "Super Sonic"],
		["Whatever, Not like I care about what they were talking about.", "Super Sonic"],
		["I'd rather get back to taking robots to this dump.", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["salvage"]]]
	]
}{"DIALOGUE":
	[
		["Well, that was fun.", "Super Sonic"],
		["Yet they still couldn't put up with me.", "Super Sonic"],
		["_skip"],
		["Anyway, should get this other job over with-", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func",
			[
				["addActor", 1, "sTalksprites_Vanny"], 
				["playMusic", "musMidnight_Vanny", 1], 
				["fadeMusic", "musMidnight_Vanny", 1, 0]
			]
		],
		
		["Ah, THERE you are~! My Cutie!", "White Rabbit"],
		["HEY!!!", "Super Sonic"],
		["_effect", 0, 5, "Shake"],
		["BACK... OFFFFFFFF!!!", "Super Sonic"],
		["_effect", 0, 33, "Shake"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
		["Wow, you're so fluffy! And very warm, yikes!", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 2]]],
		["...Say, I've never seen someone like you before. What are you a Hedgehog or something?", "White Rabbit"],
		["More than just a Hedgehog, weirdo. IT'S SUPER SONIC!", "Super Sonic"],
		["And I'd recommend you run off before I twist your neck with my bare hands in an instant! And it ain't gonna be pretty!", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
		["Jeez, is that really any way how you greet a fellow fan?", "White Rabbit"],
		["(She's really doesn't know who she's talking to, does she?)", "Super Sonic"],
		["Fellow...fan?", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 1]]],
		["C'mon, you aren't fooling me, Mr. Just-So-Happened-To-Salvage-The-One-And-Only-Springtrap-Last-Night!", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 5]]],
		["Nobody takes someone like HIM home with them unless they know exactly who he is.", "White Rabbit"],
		["...Springtrap? What nonsense are you on about?", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
		["You knooooow...the yellow rabbit? The spring bunny?", "White Rabbit"],
		["That one? You find that old cheap scraphead special?", "Super Sonic"],
		["I don't even care about that thing, I just salvaged that thing because I thought it was interesting.", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 4]]],
		["...Wooow. You really DON'T know what you've got on your hands here, huh?", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
		["...Teehee.", "White Rabbit"],
		
		["Who the hell are you, anyway? ...Also that costume looks nothing like a rabbit, fool.", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 2]]],
		["Shesh, you have such an attitude for a jerk, you know that?", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
		["Anyways, I'm quite a collector.. Yes, I'm a big fan of Freddy's memoribilia, and as for the animatronics...", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 1]]],
		["Heehee...well...I'm a PARTICULARLY big fan of them~!", "White Rabbit"],
