		["_func", [["setActor", 1]]],
		["...Right, I suppose I owe you that much for getting this far.", "Michael"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 0]]],
		["I imagine you're quite familiar with the...reputation this company has garnered by now, yes?", "Michael"],
		["Only know a bit from exploring around. That's it.", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 4]]],
		["A fair few unfortunate events have happened across these locations...I'd be the first to tell you as much.", "Michael"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 5]]],
		["Disaster after disaster, tragedy after tragedy...it wouldn't be an exaggeration to say this company has been damned since its inception.", "Michael"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 0]]],
		["...And every time a tragedy occurs, those there to witness it become...tainted. As do the objects and places surrounding them.", "Michael"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 1]]],
		["In fact, I've no doubt you've experienced this phenomenon already. All those props at the last location you visited...", "Michael"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
		["...Surely you noticed how heavy the atmosphere around them felt, yes?", "Michael"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 5]]],
		["And one particular tragedy...one which I myself was there to witness...", "Michael"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 4]]],
		["...Nowhere was it seen closer than through the eyeholes of those masks.", "Michael"],
		["Hmmmm...", "Super Sonic"],
		["So what, do these masks hold some kind of dangerous ghosts or whatever?", "Super Sonic"],
		
		["_func", [["setActor", 1]]],
		["Well, I wouldn't word it like that. These masks just seem to be imbued with some sort of strong, emotional energy.", "Michael"],
		
		["_func", [["setActor", 2]]],
		["One's potent despair, their fear, their...agony, some might call it.", "Michael"],
		["Despair, Fear, Agony...", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 0]]],
		["Yes, I've...had people in my life who studied the phenomenon very closely.", "Michael"],
		["...Yeah alright, sure.", "Super Sonic"],
