		["He's half the duo that started this whole company! Always a sideshow...but boy, what a sideshow it was!", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 5]]],
		["He might not have been the face of the place, but real Fazbear aficionados like me know the truth...he was the REAL backbone of all of this.", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 6]]],
		["Nobody put things into action like he did! Knew things like he did! Reshaped the world to his very own like he did!", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 1]]],
		["Ahhh, he's so dreamy...", "White Rabbit"],
		["...Great job skipping on the robot part, fool.", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 2]]],
		["...Oh, sorry. Of course, of course! You mean animatronic, yeah...", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 0]]],
		["Though, personally...I like to think of him as a LOT more than that.", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 2]]],
		["It's really a shame though, isn't it? He spent so long in the big guy's shadow, he never got a chance to shine...", "White Rabbit"],
		["The big guy, huh?", "Super Sonic"],
		["Is he the last ya wanted me to salvage? They could be like reunited or whatever.", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 0]]],
		["Oh, pfft, nah. Nobody knows what happened to that one. Not even me!", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
		["HE'S not the important one here, though...mweeheehee...", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 5]]],
		["Anyway, have I talked your ear off enough now? Don't forget, you still have one more to find!", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
		["Just one more, and it'll alllll come together...", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 1]]],
		["...So I hope you're looking forward to tomorrow as much as I am! See Ya Super Cutie! Hehe!", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func",
			[
				["removeActor"], 
				["fadeMusic", "musMidnight_Vanny", 0, 1000]
			]
		],
		
		["And so, the white rabbit disappeared into the darkness yet again.", ""],
		["...", "Super Sonic"],
		["_effect", 0, 3, "Shake"],
		["SHE DID NOT JUST...", "Super Sonic"],
		["_effect", 0, 30, "Shake"],
		["I AM THIS CLOSE TO WANTING TO KILL HER. I SWEAR TO GOD.", "Super Sonic"],
		["_effect", 0, 125, "Shake"],
		["...Ugh, but it's a waste of time and energy.", "Super Sonic"],
		["Gotta admit though, I'm quite curious about this 'Big Guy' she's been talking about.", "Super Sonic"],
		["Bah, whatever. Just one more before she can finally get off my tail.", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["salvage"]]]
	]
} {"DIALOGUE":
	[
		["_func",
			[
				["addActor", 0, "sTalksprites_Michael"], 
				["playMusic", "musMidnight_Michael", 1], 
				["fadeMusic", "musMidnight_Michael", 1, 0]
			]
		],
		
		["...And so you came through.", "Michael"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
		["...Thank you. I knew you were the one for this job.", "Michael"],
		["Yeah yeah, be happy I did your little errands.", "Super Sonic"],
		["Now, you don't doubt what I'm capable of, do ya?", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 4]]],
		["...No. Not anymore.", "Michael"],
		["That's what I thought.", "Super Sonic"],
		["...So that's all you needed, right?", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 0]]],
		["...", "Michael"],
		["...Ugh, There's more I have to do, isn't there?", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 4]]],
		["...Yes. I'm afraid our work here is not quite done.", "Michael"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 1]]],
		["First and foremost, you're going to need this.", "Michael"],
		["Michael shuffles around in his pockets before pulling something out, leaning forward and placing it in your hands.", ""],
		["It's...a portable game console?", ""],
		["...Why are you giving me this junk? Do I look like I play games?", "Super Sonic"],
		
		["_func", [["setActor", 0]]],
		["Remember what I told you about the arcade cabinets a few nights ago?", "Michael"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 2]]],
		["I have cause to believe the same properties apply even to a device like this.", "Michael"],
      		["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
		["We'll need it to contact that...old friend I told you about.", "Michael"],
		["...What about the masks? Don't tell me I got those for nothing.", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 0]]],
		["Those are to draw him out.", "Michael"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 2]]],
		["I understand that you do not have a shift tomorrow, but I must ask that you humor me and come in anyway. Same time as your regular shift.", "Michael"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
		["And it MUST be tomorrow, to be clear. There won't be another chance to do this for a long, long time. Understand?", "Michael"],
		["...", "Super Sonic"],
		["...Yeah sure, whatever.", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 0]]],
		["Wonderful. Now, go home and rest...the last thing you'll want to do tomorrow is doze off.", "Michael"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
		["And do not. Forget. The handheld.", "Michael"],
		["_func",
			[
				["removeActor"], 
				["fadeMusic", "musMidnight_Michael", 0, 1000]
			]
		],
		
		["And so, Michael returns to the darkness. For a moment, he stops, looks you in the eye, and nods, before continuing on his way.", ""],
		["There's a lot that could go wrong tomorrow, but in spite your natural reservations...", ""],
		["...You steel yourself, and prepare for what's to come.", ""],
		
		["_split", false, "HasTalbert", true, 
			[
				["_money"]
			],
			[
				["_func", [["night6", "michael"]]]
			]
		]
	]
} {"DIALOGUE":
	[
		["Gotta admit, this first week was quite hilarious.", "Super Sonic"],
		["All those robots, yet not even close to defeating me.", "Super Sonic"],
		["_delay", 120],
		["_func", [["playSound", "sfxPhoneRing", 10, true]]],
		["...You're kidding me.", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func",
			[
				["stopSound", "sfxPhoneRing"],
				["playSound", "sfxPhonePickup", 10, false]
			]
		],
		
		["_delay", 120],
		["WAAAAAAAAAAHH!!", "The Boss"],
		["_effect", 0, 99, "Shake"],
		["_func", [["playMusic", "musMidnight_TheBoss", 0.5]]],
		["Jeez, you sound like your in a mood tonight.", "Super Sonic"],
		["NO! I'M NOT IN THE MOOD!", "The Boss"],
		["_effect", 0, 30, "Shake"],
		["_effect", 18, 20, "Shake"],
		["I've been SCAMMED! SWINDLED! HOODWINKED!", "The Boss"],
		["_effect", 10, 99, "Shake"],
		["When were you gonna tell me about these files, huh!?", "The Boss"],
		["Files? what are you on about?", "Super Sonic"],
		["The ones I found in your office, you stooge! I took a look through them, and as it turns out...", "The Boss"],
		["Those jerks who sold me the company were hiding MILLIONS in property RIGHT UNDER MY NOSE!", "The Boss"],
		["Look, you're the only chump I can trust with this, so shut your trap and listen up!", "The Boss"],
		["According to these files, there's a secret bunker out there in the middle of the woods.", "The Boss"],
		["And, more importantly...the place is stuffed to the brim with animatronics that could make me RRRRRRRICH!!", "The Boss"],
		["_effect", 94, 128, "Shake"],
		["_split", false, "IsGoodOrEvil", false,
			[
				["Dude, I already worked my full week here. It'd be more pretty if you got someone else to do it.", "Super Sonic"],
				["Grrr...FINE! I'll sweeten the deal.", "The Boss"],
				["If you do this for me, I'll take you out to a steakhouse I like. My treat!", "The Boss"],
				["...Steakhouse? Never heard of those.", "Super Sonic"],
				["Fine, I'll give this 'Steakhouse' a try, whatever it is.", "Super Sonic"],
				["Wahaha, excellent! I knew I could count on you, rodent.", "The Boss"],
				["Now MOVE IT!! Time is money!", "The Boss"],
				["_effect", 4, 13, "Shake"]
			],
			[
				["I need you to crawl down there and retrieve those bots! And it better be NOW!", "The Boss"],
				["...Oh, and if you do, I'll, uh...take you out to dinner or something. My treat!", "The Boss"],
				["I BETTER see you there!", "The Boss"]
			]
		],
		["_delay", 120],
		["_func",
			[
				["stopSound", "musMidnight_TheBoss"],
				["playSound", "sfxPhonePickup", 10, false]
			]
		],
		
		["_split", false, "IsGoodOrEvil", true,
			[
				["...Well, you can't do two things at once. You've got a choice to make here.", ""],
				["Who will you along with?", ""],
				["_option", ["Help the Boss", "ChoiceConfirm_Money"]],
				["_split", false, "IsGood", true,
					[
						["_option", ["Help Michael", "ChoiceConfirm_Good"]]
					],
					[
						["_option", ["Help the Rabbit", "ChoiceConfirm_Evil"]]
					]
				]
			],
			[
				["I swear, I better not regret this.", "Super Sonic"],
				["_func", [["salvage"]]]
			]
		]
	]
}{"DIALOGUE":
	[
		["_func",
			[
				["addActor", 0, "sTalksprites_Michael"], 
				["playMusic", "musMidnight_MissingChild", 1], 
				["fadeMusic", "musMidnight_MissingChild", 1, 0],
				["fadeMusic", "musMidnight_TheBoss", 1, 0],
				["fadeMusic", "sfxWindyAmbience", 0, 0]
			]
		],
		["Well...", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 4]]],
		["It seems that despite our best efforts to warn you...", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["switchActor", [4, 1], "sTalksprites_Vanny"]]],
		["...You still wound up seeing this thing through to the end.", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 7]]],
		["Seriously, what is your deal!? Are you just doing this for fun!?", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 6]]],
		["You didn't make ANYONE happy here! All you did was...TICK US OFF!!", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["switchActor", [2, 0]]]],
		["For once, I agree with her. This...really accomplished nothing.", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 1]]],
		["Our goals are fundamentally incompatible. If this was your way of finding a compromise between us, I'm afraid it was all in vain.", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
		["If you want to do any good with what you've collected here...you'll need to choose between us.", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["switchActor", [5, 1]]]],
		["Well, he's not gonna side with YOU, that's for sure.", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 4]]],
		["...Though I also doubt he'll want to side with me either, considering all that stuff I said last night...", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 5]]],
		["But hey, water under the bridge, eh?", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 1]]],
		["You've got four LOVELY little animatronics here... Why don't we let bygones be bygones and make the most out of them?", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 0]]],
		["I'll be sure to reward you HANDSOMELY if you do~!", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["switchActor", [4, 0]]]],
		["If you're smart, you won't fall for such an obvious bribe.", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 1]]],
		["Listen, I understand that we may have gotten off on the wrong foot...but you do still have one last chance to do some good here.", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 0]]],
		["Hand over those masks, and you'll never have to hear from either of us again.", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 2]]],
		["Then, you'll be free to...do whatever it is you're trying to do here.", "Hooded Man"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
		["Will you make the right choice?", "Hooded Man"],
		
		["_split", false, "HasTalbert", true, 
			[
				["_skip"],
				["Alright, Shut up you two, I-", "Super Sonic"],
				["_delay", 120],
				["_func",
					[
						["stopSound", "musMidnight_MissingChild"],
						["playSound", "sfxPhoneRing", 10, true]
					]
				],
				["_buffer"],
				["_func", [["switchActor", [2, 1]]]],
				["...Uhh, who's that?", "White Rabbit"],
				["...Ugh, it's my stupid boss.", "Super Sonic"],
				["_func",
					[
						["stopSound", "sfxPhoneRing"],
						["playSound", "sfxPhonePickup", 10, false]
					]
				],
				["_delay", 120],
				
				["WAAAAAAAAAAHH!!", "The Boss"],
				["_effect", 0, 99, "Shake"],
				["_func", [["playMusic", "musMidnight_TheBoss", 0.5]]],
				["Jeez, you sound like your in a mood tonight.", "Super Sonic"],
				["NO! I'M NOT IN THE MOOD!", "The Boss"],
				["_effect", 0, 30, "Shake"],
				["_effect", 18, 20, "Shake"],
				["When were you gonna tell me about these FILES, huh!?", "The Boss"],
				["_func", [["switchActor", [0, 0]]]],
				["Files? What files?", "Hooded Man"],
				["Eh? Is there another guy with you?", "The Boss"],
				["Yeah, talk to Mr. Zombie-That-Doesn't-Take-Showers.", "Super Sonic"],
				["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
				["Please don't call me that again...", "Hooded Man"],
				["_func", [["switchActor", [0, 1]]]],
				["Uh... Hi there, Mr. Bossman!", "White Rabbit"],
				["Hey, chump! It's me, the...", "The Boss"],
				["...Hey, wait a second! I recognize that voice! You're that creep who's been loitering outside my restaurant!", "The Boss"],
				["_func", [["switchActor", [0, 0]]]],
				["And you! The other guy! You two are trying to swindle my employees away, aren't you!?", "The Boss"],
				["_func", [["setActor", 4]]],
				["Ah, so YOU'RE the one who's decided to keep this walking corpse of a brand alive.", "Hooded Man"],
				["_func", [["setActor", 1]]],
				["I have to say, you're certainly living up to everything I expected you to be.", "Hooded Man"],
				["Bah, some nerve! Don't think I can't see what you're trying to do here.", "The Boss"],
				["You're trying to get my employees to do your dirty work for you...when the only person they do unpaid work for is ME!", "The Boss"],
				["_func", [["switchActor", [4, 1]]]],
				["Now, get lost before you cost me anymore of my time! My employee needs to get back to what REALLY matters here...", "The Boss"],
				["Making. Me. RRRRRRRRRRICH!!", "The Boss"],
				["_effect", 12, 99, "Shake"],
				
				["_func",
					[
						["switchActor", [1, 0]],
						["playSound", "sfxMetalImpact", 10, false, 0.5]
					]
				],
				["Oh, what REALLY matters!?", "Hooded Man"],
				["...He snatched the phone right out of your hands.", ""],
				["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
				["If you cared about what REALLY mattered, you wouldn't have bought this company in the first place!", "Hooded Man"],
				["_func", [["setActor", 4]]],
				["Dragging on its miserable legacy, all for a couple pennies...you're absolutely despicable!", "Hooded Man"],
				["_func", [["switchActor", [5, 1]]]],
				["Pssh, yeah, not to mention nowhere NEAR as charming as the old owner.", "White Rabbit"],
				["_func", [["switchActor", [5, 0]]]],
				["Quiet. You're not part of this.", "Hooded Man"],
				["I'm bored. I'd rather mind my own business. Have a nice argument!", "Super Sonic"],
				["Super Sonic flew out of the scene.", ""],
				["_prescripted_sequence", "talbert"],
				
				["...You walk off, ignoring the ongoing argument between the three.", ""],
				["Thinking about your actions over the past few days, you wonder what the point of them were.", ""],
				["Why? You took on so much unnecessary extra work for this job, and for what?", ""],
				["For people who only care about themselves? So you can just waste extra time?", ""],
				["...You grit your teeth. Everybody's playing you for a fool, keeping you just enough in the dark so you'll help them.", ""],
				["Why should you try being nice for once even if you've lost a lot of your Chaos Energy? If that's not what you normally do?", ""],
				["...But, maybe... The answers you seek are closer than you realize.", ""],
				["Awkwardly trying to find somewhere to rest, that's when you feel it.", ""],
				["_func", [["talbertReveal"]]],
				["...Those files you bought earlier.", ""],
				["You don't know who Talbert is, but...", ""],
				["Without even opening them, you can sense it. The history everyone hid from you...", ""],
				["...Until now.", ""],
				["If you're only a few turns of the page away from the context you seek...", ""],
				["...Then...", ""],
				["_func", 
					[
						["talbertPuppet"],
						["stopSound", "sfxWindyAmbience"]
					]
				],
				["...Why don't we read them...together?", ""],
				["_func", [["talbert"]]]
			],
					
			[
				["Well, it seems no matter what decision you make here...somebody will be left behind. Some loose end will remain untied.", ""],
				["Perhaps under different circumstances, in another life...there would be some way to make both of them happy.", ""],
				["...But that life isn't the one you're living, so you'll have to choose.", ""],
				["Who will you go along with?", ""],
				["_option", ["Michael", "ChoiceConfirmUlt_Good"]],
				["_option", ["The rabbit", "ChoiceConfirmUlt_Evil"]]
			]
		]
	]
} {"DIALOGUE":
	[
		["_func",
			[
				["addActor", 1, "sTalksprites_Vanny"], 
				["playMusic", "musMidnight_Vanny", 1], 
				["fadeMusic", "musMidnight_Vanny", 1, 0]
			]
		],
		
		["...Oh, you beautiful, BEAUTIFUL little thing, you!", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
		["You really got them...ALL of them...", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 1]]],
		["Oh, I'm so happy, I could KISS you!", "White Rabbit"],
		["DON'T EVEN TRY.", "Super Sonic"],
		["_effect", 0, 30, "Shake"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
		["Hehe, y'know I find it cute when you're angry like that!", "White Rabbit"],
		["(Great. Just Great.)", "Super Sonic"],
		["_effect", 0, 25, "Shake"],
		["...Ugh, anyway, I got you your little 'Family' back. Now where's the reward you've promised, huh?", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 4]]],
		["...Reward?", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 1]]],
		["OH, right! Teehee, I nearly forgot!", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 6]]],
		["Yes, yes...I've got all the pieces I need now...I should be able to get it together for you in no time!", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 5]]],
		["...If you can give me a day.", "White Rabbit"],
		["It better be somethin' better than cash.", "Super Sonic"],
		["(Because if it is something better like a battle, HA! Count me in.)", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 2]]],
		["Cash? Fahaha, don't make me laugh! It's something WAY better than that!", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 6]]],
		["Once you get it, you'll feel like your whole life has been leading up to it! It's...it's priceless!", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 5]]],
		["I'd even go as far to say it's to DIE for!", "White Rabbit"],
		["Hoho! Now we're talkin!' I like where this is going.", "Super Sonic"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 3]]],
		["Wow, you seems very determined for what I've got prepared.", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func", [["setActor", 0]]],
		["If you're that excited, come back here tomorrow, 12 AM. You will NOT wanna miss what I have for you.", "White Rabbit"],
		["_func",
			[
				["removeActor"], 
				["fadeMusic", "musMidnight_Vanny", 0, 1000]
			]
		],
		
		["And so, the white rabbit disappeared into the darkness...for what may be the final time.", ""],
		["The restaurant isn't even open tomorrow...", "Super Sonic"],
		["...But, ya know me. What's rules gonna do against me? Hahahaha!", "Super Sonic"],
		["I may hate her, but whatever she's preparing, I'm sure it'll be something I won't regret.", "Super Sonic"],
		
		["_split", false, "HasTalbert", true, 
			[
				["_money"]
			],	
			[
				["_func", [["night6", "vanny"]]]
			]
		]
	]
} ‰PNG
